OL,3,A'A real privilege' - Casualty star to
OL,4,Alead drama's 40th anniversary special
OL,5,
OL,6,FCasualty actor William Beck has said it
OL,7,Fis a privilege to lead the audience
OL,8,Fthrough the show's 40th anniversary
OL,9,Fspecial.
OL,11,FThe BBC medical drama, which is the
OL,12,Fworld's longest-running show of its
OL,13,Fkind, will celebrate the milestone in
OL,14,FSeptember with a two-part story.
OL,16,FThe special will see a "high-stakes
OL,17,Fmajor incident" throw Holby City
OL,18,FHospital into chaos, with Beck's
OL,19,Fcharacter Dylan Keogh battling personal
OL,20,Ftragedy while leading his team through
OL,21,Ftheir darkest hour, according to the
OL,22,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
