OL,3,A'A real privilege' - Casualty star to
OL,4,Alead drama's 40th anniversary special
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeck said the special would be
OL,7,F"entertaining as well as traumatic",
OL,8,Fand would put his character at its
OL,9,Fcentre "in a way that he hasn't been
OL,10,Fbefore".
